 "text": "Recorder | Dallas County, IA\nSkip To Main Content This website is AudioEye enabled and is being optimized for accessibility. To open the AudioEye Toolbar, press \"shift + =\". Some assistive technologies may require the use of a passthrough function before this keystroke. For more information, activate the button labeled \"Explore your accessibility options\".\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nSearch\nGovernment\nServices\nOur Community\nHow Do I...\nHome\nGovernment\nCounty Government\nRecorder\nRecorder\nWelcome!\nThank you for visiting the Dallas County Recorder's Office. Our office contains valuable information concerning your home, family, business, and recreation. The Recorder's office maintains all official real estate documents and provides retrieval of those records. We issue marriage licenses and provide copies of birth, death, and marriage certificates. The Recorder's office also issues boat, snowmobile, ORM, ORV, UTV, and ATV registrations and titles.\nIt is our goal to provide accurate information for the public. We hope our website helps you to find the information you are looking for. If you need further assistance, please contact our office at 515-993-5804 or send us a message .\nPassports are done by appointment only. All other in-person transactions must be done during office hours with no appointment necessary. Please call us at 515-993-5804 to make an appointment for a passport.\nOnline Record Search\nContact Us\nReNae Arnold\nRecorder\nEmail Recorder\nPhysical Address\n800 Court Street Suite 130\nAdministration Building 1st Fl\nAdel , IA 50003\nPhone: 515-993-5804\nHours\nAll in-person transactions except passports:\nMonday through Friday\n8:00 am to 4 pm\nPassports by appointment only\nDepartment of Natural Resources (DNR)\nMarriage License\nMilitary Records\nNotary Fraud Alert Program\nPassports\nProperty Fraud Alert Program\nReal Estate\nTrade Names\nTransfer Tax Calculator\nVital Records\nHome\nSearch\nContact Us\nSubscribe\n-->\nProperty Search\nMotor Vehicle\nElections\nPay My Taxes\nRecorder\nJob Opportunities\nContact Us\nDallas County\nOffices in Adel and Perry, IA\nGeneral Information 515-993-5801\nContact Us\nSocial Media\nFacebook\nX\nNextDoor\nSite Links\nSite Map\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\nPrivacy Policy\nEmployee Sign-In\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×\nOpens in new window\nPDF Download\nWord Download\nExcel Download\nPowerPoint Download\nDocument Download\nExplore your accessibility options",
